\end{equation}
Since $p_iC^{ks,i}_j=-C^{ks}_j$, then we obtain
\[
p^jp_iC^{ks,i,u}_j=2g^{uj}C^{ks}_j=2C^{kus}.
\]
Also, since
$C^{us}_hp^h=0$, then we have
\[
